{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53543","headline":"石榴花 · 元稹","name":"石榴花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥落山榴深映叶，红霞浅带碧霄云。\n麴尘枝下年年见，别似衣裳不似裙。\n（《永乐大典》卷八二一引《瓮牖闲评》引）（〖1〗以上二诗据《古籍整理出版情况简报》一六六期刊冀勤同志《元稹佚诗续辑》录出。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}